{"unit_id":"little-traincar__dsh-imagegen#card-zh","repo":"little-traincar/dsh-imagegen","commit":"0f9f1a7aa4b11321dc7f16eba26cdd8e7df54173","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-imagegen 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的图像生成插件，通过注册 generate_image 工具让 agent 根据文字描述调用图像模型。它内置 Doubao Seedream 和 Qwen，也支持配置 OpenAI 兼容接口及本地部署；可指定模型或别名、画面比例、生成数量和随机种子，提供参考图进行图生图，并可要求图中文字逐行照录。生成图片会保存到配置目录，并可附加到会话中显示。适合需要在 DSH 对话中制作海报、插图或基于参考图改绘的用户。使用内置远程提供方时需配置对应服务的 API key；也可连接无需密钥的本地服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:378-395","src/index.js:451-490","src/providers.js:7-8"]}
{"unit_id":"little-traincar__dsh-imagegen#card-en","repo":"little-traincar/dsh-imagegen","commit":"0f9f1a7aa4b11321dc7f16eba26cdd8e7df54173","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-imagegen adds a generate_image tool to DSH Web. It creates images from prompts with Doubao, Qwen, custom compatible services, or local endpoints. Calls can use reference images, select a model and aspect ratio, request several candidates, and save or attach results to the conversation.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:378-395","src/index.js:451-490","src/providers.js:7-8"]}
